  <h1>KLIQ</h1>
  <p>Creator Social Platform — Full Application Documentation</p>
  <p class="sub">Prototype 3 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Built with Vite · React · TypeScript · Tailwind CSS<br>
  Prepared: June 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Version 1.0</p>
