<!-- ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<h1>1. Executive Summary</h1>
<p>KLIQ is a multi-platform social media and content creator ecosystem designed as a unified home for creators across short-form video, long-form content, live streaming, premium series, community discussion, and e-commerce. The platform combines the best elements of Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Twitch, Netflix, Etsy, and Discord into a single cohesive product.</p>

<p>The prototype (prot_3) is a fully functional front-end demonstration built in React and TypeScript, demonstrating the complete user experience across all major product areas. All navigation, modals, forms, and interactive states are implemented. No backend is connected; all data is static/seeded.</p>

<div class="highlight">
  <strong>Key Product Promise:</strong> One platform for creators to post, stream, publish, sell, and connect — with a token-based economy rewarding content and engagement.
</div>

<!-- ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<h1>2. Technology Stack</h1>
<table>
  <tr><th>Layer</th><th>Technology</th><th>Version</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Build Tool</td><td>Vite</td><td>6.3.5</td><td>Fast dev server &amp; production bundler</td></tr>
  <tr><td>UI Framework</td><td>React</td><td>18.3.1</td><td>Component-based UI rendering</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Language</td><td>TypeScript</td><td>~5.8</td><td>Type-safe development</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Styling</td><td>Tailwind CSS</td><td>4.1.12</td><td>Utility-first CSS framework</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Routing</td><td>React Router</td><td>7.13.0</td><td>Client-side page navigation</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Charts</td><td>Recharts</td><td>2.15.2</td><td>Analytics charts &amp; graphs</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Icons</td><td>Lucide React</td><td>0.487.0</td><td>Consistent icon library</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Avatars</td><td>DiceBear API</td><td>7.x</td><td>Generated user avatars</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Images</td><td>Unsplash API</td><td>—</td><td>Placeholder content images</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Animations</td><td>tw-animate-css</td><td>1.3.8</td><td>CSS animation utilities</td></tr>
  <tr><td>UI Primitives</td><td>Radix UI</td><td>Various</td><td>Accessible headless components</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<h1>3. Application Architecture</h1>

<h2>3.1 File Structure</h2>
<pre style="font-family: Consolas, monospace; background: #f8f8f8; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 10pt;">
src/
├── app/
│   ├── App.tsx              ← Root app with context providers
│   ├── routes.tsx           ← All React Router routes
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── Layout.tsx       ← Persistent nav wrapper (sidebar + mobile bar)
│   │   ├── CommentSheet.tsx ← Reusable comment drawer
│   │   ├── ShareSheet.tsx   ← Reusable share bottom sheet
│   │   ├── MoreMenuSheet.tsx← Post action menu
│   │   └── ActionPanel.tsx  ← Post action buttons
│   ├── context/
│   │   ├── UserContext.tsx  ← Tier, tab visibility state
│   │   ├── SocialContext.tsx← Follow/unfollow, My List state
│   │   └── NotificationContext.tsx ← Notifications + unread count
│   └── pages/
│       └── [30+ page files]
└── styles/
    ├── tailwind.css
    ├── fonts.css
    └── theme.css
</pre>

<h2>3.2 Routing</h2>
<p>React Router v7 with a nested layout structure. The root <code>/</code> path renders the <code>Layout</code> component, which wraps all main pages with the persistent navigation bar. Special pages (Login, Onboarding, StoryViewer, KliqStreamWatch) render outside the layout without the nav bar.</p>

<h2>3.3 Context Providers</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Context</th><th>State</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td>UserContext</td><td>tier (1|2|3), tabVisibility</td><td>Controls which features are unlocked based on subscription tier</td></tr>
  <tr><td>SocialContext</td><td>followed: Set&lt;string&gt;, myList: Set&lt;string&gt;</td><td>Tracks who the user follows and their KliqStream watchlist</td></tr>
  <tr><td>NotificationContext</td><td>notifications[], unreadCount</td><td>Global notification feed and unread badge count</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<h1>4. User Tier System</h1>
<p>KLIQ uses a tiered subscription model that unlocks progressively more powerful creator tools:</p>
<table>
  <tr><th>Tier</th><th>Name</th><th>Price</th><th>Unlocks</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge">★☆☆ Tier 1</span></td>
    <td>Basic</td>
    <td>Free</td>
    <td>Home feed, Stories, Reels, Posts, KliqTube viewing, Community, Inbox, Search, Wallet (basic), Profile</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge badge-blue">★★☆ Tier 2</span></td>
    <td>Plus</td>
    <td>$9.99/mo</td>
    <td>All Tier 1 + KliqStream browsing, Advanced analytics, Revenue earnings visibility, KliqStream tab on profile</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge badge-orange">★★★ Tier 3</span></td>
    <td>Pro</td>
    <td>$29.99/mo</td>
    <td>All Tier 2 + Marketplace storefront, Studio dashboard, Partner Program, Priority amplification</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p>The tier is set via the Settings page and persists in the UserContext. Tab visibility can be customised per-tab from Settings (Everyone / Friends Only / Hidden).</p>

<!-- ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<h1>5. Sign-Up &amp; Onboarding Flow</h1>

<h2>5.1 Login Page</h2>
<p>Dual-mode page (Login / Register). Login mode shows email + password fields with a "Forgot password?" flow. Register mode is a 2-step form:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Step 1 — Credentials:</strong> Email, Password (with live strength meter: weak/fair/strong), Confirm Password (with real-time match indicator). Also offers Google OAuth shortcut.</li>
  <li><strong>Step 2 — Personal Details:</strong> Full Name (required), Phone Number (optional, US-formatted), Date of Birth (required, age-gated at 13+), Gender (optional dropdown: Male / Female / Non-binary / Prefer not to say), Terms of Service + Privacy Policy + Community Guidelines checkbox.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5.2 Forgot Password Flow</h2>
<p>Clicking "Forgot password?" shows an email input screen. On submit, the UI transitions to a confirmation screen showing the email address a reset link was "sent" to, with a "Back to Sign In" button.</p>

<h2>5.3 Onboarding (4 steps)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Step</th><th>Screen</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>1</td><td>Interests</td><td>Grid of 12 interest categories (Music, Travel, Gaming, Art, Fitness, Food, Tech, Fashion, Sports, Movies, Comedy, Nature). User picks at least 1 to continue.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>2</td><td>Suggested Creators</td><td>List of 6 creators with follow/unfollow buttons powered by SocialContext. Can skip.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>3</td><td>Profile Setup</td><td>Avatar picker (8 presets + camera upload placeholder), Display Name, @Username (3–20 chars, validated, live availability check). Live profile preview card updates in real time.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>4</td><td>Done</td><td>"You're all set!" screen with Sparkles animation, shows @username. "Start Exploring" navigates to Home.</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<h1>6. Page Inventory &amp; Feature Descriptions</h1>

<h2>6.1 Core Social Pages</h2>

<h3>Home</h3>
<p>TikTok-style full-screen vertical feed with three tabs: <strong>Following</strong>, <strong>For You</strong>, and <strong>Live</strong>.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Double-tap to like (floating heart animation)</li>
  <li>Comment sheet (slide-up drawer with replies)</li>
  <li>Share sheet (bottom sheet with copy link, DM, etc.)</li>
  <li>More menu (report, save, not interested)</li>
  <li>Follow button on post, links to user profile</li>
  <li>Live tab shows active streams with viewer counts and live badges</li>
</ul>

<h3>Friends</h3>
<p>Stories row at the top (circular avatars) with "+" add story button. Story viewer is a full-screen multi-story experience.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Story tap navigation: tap right = next slide, tap left = previous, swipe down = dismiss</li>
  <li>Multi-user story progression across 6 story users</li>
  <li>Story upload modal (for own story)</li>
  <li>People You May Know section with follow buttons</li>
  <li>Activity feed (likes, comments, follows from friends)</li>
</ul>

<h3>Search</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Full-text search filtering across accounts, tags, and videos simultaneously</li>
  <li>Trending hashtags row</li>
  <li>Instagram-style explore grid (masonry layout with spanning cells)</li>
  <li>Account results with follow buttons; Video results with view counts</li>
</ul>

<h3>Create</h3>
<p>Full camera UI with three modes:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Photo:</strong> Shutter button with filter selector row</li>
  <li><strong>Video:</strong> Toggle record button (REC badge while recording) → caption screen → post success</li>
  <li><strong>Live:</strong> Title + category setup → Go Live → active live screen with viewer count, chat bubbles, End Stream</li>
</ul>

<h3>Inbox</h3>
<p>Two-tab interface: Notifications and Chats.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Notifications: Real-time notification feed from NotificationContext (like, follow, comment, mention, earn). Follow notifications show Follow Back button.</li>
  <li>Chats: List of DM conversations with unread counts, streak indicators, and last message preview. Navigates to ChatConversation.</li>
  <li>Bell badge in Layout header shows live unread count from NotificationContext.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6.2 Content Platforms</h2>

<h3>KliqTube</h3>
<p>YouTube-style long-form video platform. Features:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Subscriptions row (avatar circles linking to channels)</li>
  <li>Category filter bar (All, Gaming, Music, Tech, Education, etc.)</li>
  <li>Featured video hero banner</li>
  <li>Video grid with thumbnails, duration badges, channel avatars</li>
  <li>Search bar (real-time filter by title or channel)</li>
  <li>Upload modal with title, category, and success confirmation screen</li>
  <li>Channel page: banner, subscriber count, Videos / Playlists / About tabs</li>
  <li>Watch page: full player with controls, like/dislike, comments, related videos</li>
</ul>

<h3>KliqStream</h3>
<p>Netflix-style premium content browser. Features:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Tier 2+ gated (prompts upgrade for Tier 1)</li>
  <li>Hero banner with featured title</li>
  <li>Horizontal content rows: New Releases, Drama, Action, etc.</li>
  <li>Add to My List (SocialContext) with toggle</li>
  <li>Watch page: full-screen player with progress scrubber, skip ±10s, mute, like</li>
  <li>My List page: saved titles grid</li>
</ul>

<h3>Community</h3>
<p>Reddit/Discord-style forum platform. Features:</p>
<ul>
  <li>My Feed tab: post cards with upvote toggle, reply count, pinned badge</li>
  <li>Discover tab: community directory with Join/Joined toggle</li>
  <li>Long-press on admin community → settings sheet (Edit, Manage Members, Rules, etc.)</li>
  <li>Community Chat: group WhatsApp-style chat with reactions, swipe-to-reply, emoji panel, members modal</li>
  <li>Post Detail: full post with comment thread</li>
  <li>Create Community: 3-step wizard (details → invite members → launch) with in-page success screen</li>
</ul>

<h2>6.3 Creator Monetisation</h2>

<h3>Marketplace</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Product grid with images, prices, seller info</li>
  <li>Tier 3 storefront banner (upgrade prompt for lower tiers)</li>
  <li>Sell modal: product name, price, description, category — with in-page success confirmation</li>
  <li>Store Profile page for individual seller pages</li>
  <li>Customize Shop page for Tier 3 creators</li>
</ul>

<h3>Amplify</h3>
<p>Paid content promotion tool. 4-step setup:</p>
<ol>
  <li>Select a post (portrait grid with view count badges)</li>
  <li>Choose goal: More Views / More Followers / More Website Visits</li>
  <li>Audience: Automatic (AI-selected)</li>
  <li>Budget slider (100–5,000 tokens) + Duration slider (1–30 days), quick-pick buttons, daily spend display, estimated reach calculation (updates live based on both sliders)</li>
</ol>
<p>Clicking "Pay & Start Amplify" shows a campaign success screen with all campaign details and links to Analytics.</p>

<h3>Wallet</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Balance display (USD + Token + Diamond counts)</li>
  <li>Top Up modal: fiat (quick picks + custom amount, token bonus preview) or crypto</li>
  <li>Withdraw modal</li>
  <li>Transfer modal: send tokens or diamonds to another user</li>
  <li>Transaction history list</li>
  <li>Success toast notifications on all actions</li>
</ul>

<h3>Analytics</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Overview cards: Reach, Engagement Rate, Followers Gained, Est. Revenue</li>
  <li>Interactive bar chart (Views by day) and line chart (Follower growth)</li>
  <li>Top content table with performance metrics</li>
  <li>Tier-gated deep analytics (Tier 2+). "Upgrade to Pro" button links to Settings.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6.4 Profile &amp; Account</h2>

<h3>Profile (Own)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Cover photo + avatar with tier badge stars</li>
  <li>Stats: Posts, Followers (clickable list), Following (clickable list), Likes</li>
  <li>Followers/Following lists show avatars with follow-back buttons</li>
  <li>Privacy toggle (show/hide each list with lock icon)</li>
  <li>Scrollable tabs: Posts · Reels · KliqTube · KliqStream · Marketplace · Community</li>
  <li>Edit Profile button → Edit Profile page (display name, username, bio, website, privacy toggle)</li>
  <li>Share button → ShareSheet</li>
</ul>

<h3>UserProfile (Others)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Same tab layout as own profile but with Follow / Message / Gift buttons</li>
  <li>Stats and bio are deterministically varied per username (hash-based)</li>
  <li>Each tab shows relevant content with navigation links into KliqTube watch, Stream watch, etc.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Settings</h3>
<p>Comprehensive settings page with multiple expandable sections:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Account: change username, linked accounts, phone, 2FA</li>
  <li>Notifications: per-type toggle (Likes, Comments, Follows, DMs, etc.)</li>
  <li>Privacy: who can follow, DM, comment; restricted words</li>
  <li>Appearance: font size, reduce motion, content density</li>
  <li>Language &amp; Region: full language list (15 languages)</li>
  <li>Tier Upgrade: shows current tier, upgrade path, pricing</li>
  <li>Tab Visibility: per-tab control (Everyone / Friends / Hidden)</li>
  <li>Marketplace Analytics: GMV, orders, conversion rate charts (Tier 3)</li>
  <li>Blocked Users: list with unblock button</li>
  <li>FAQ: expandable Q&amp;A</li>
  <li>Report a Problem: category selector + text field</li>
  <li>Log Out / Delete Account</li>
</ul>

<h3>Studio</h3>
<p>Content management dashboard for all platform uploads. Features:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Summary stats: Total Views, Followers, Engagement, Revenue (tier-gated)</li>
  <li>Interactive charts (bar + line)</li>
  <li>Platform filter: All / Social / KliqTube / Stream / Marketplace</li>
  <li>Content list with thumbnail, status badges (Published / Pending / Processing / Rejected)</li>
  <li>Per-platform colour coding</li>
</ul>

<h2>6.5 Communication</h2>

<h3>ChatConversation</h3>
<ul>
  <li>WhatsApp-style DM thread</li>
  <li>Long-press message → reaction menu or reply</li>
  <li>Swipe-to-reply gesture</li>
  <li>Emoji panel</li>
  <li>Media gallery picker</li>
  <li>Chat customisation: accent colour themes</li>
  <li>Audio / Video call overlay</li>
  <li>Clear chat, block, report options</li>
</ul>

<h3>Payment</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Order summary card</li>
  <li>Credit card mode: name, card number (auto-formatted XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX), expiry, CVV</li>
  <li>Crypto mode: ETH wallet address, amount in ETH, network info</li>
  <li>Inline validation error (no alert dialogs)</li>
  <li>Success screen with transaction receipt</li>
</ul>

